  "goodToKnow": "Das Kontingent is a quota or allocation: ein Kontingent an Zimmern, Impfstoffkontingente, Einfuhrkontingente (import quotas). It also means a military contingent: das deutsche Kontingent der UN-Mission. Kontingentieren means to impose quotas. Germany's Kontingentflüchtlinge were refugees admitted in fixed numbers, such as Jewish immigrants from the former Soviet Union after 1991. Plural: die Kontingente."
